---
description: Offer feasible, explicitly scoped choices including the customer's requested exit.
args:{scope:GoalContract;policy:PolicySelection;intent:ChangeIntent;consequences:ChangeConsequence[];entitlements:EvidencePage[]}
returns:ChangeOption[]
---
Include the requested permitted action as a clear choice, with exact subscriptions, effective date, surviving obligations and data effects. Add alternatives only when allowed by the request and governing terms. Do not mark any choice selected; require explicit consent bound to exact option and version.
